	"Description": "Now there is an English translation!\n<br />Hi! This mod was created because I wanted something interesting and easy to craft.\n<br />I also asked my vk subscribers what they would like to add to the game, and I added it.\n<br />Crafting is very easy, at first, as soon as you start your farm game, you can already cook something from my dishes.\n<br />I will be glad if you like my mod.\n<br />This mod adds the following dishes:\n<br />A herring under a fur coat\n<br />Cheese soup\n<br />Octopus with fruits and berries\n<br />Cloudberries in sugar\n<br />Fish on a stick (Shish kebab)\n<br />Beetle on a stick (Shish kebab)\n<br />Chuck-chuck\n<br />Dumplings with cherries\n<br />Fish pie\n<br />Cakes\n<br />Fried slime\n<br />Seeds of the \"joy of the pigeon\"\n<br />Beetle Steak\n<br />The mayor's Golden Candy\n<br />A hearty breakfast of scrambled eggs and a piece of fresh bread",
